/* 🖐️ شريط يمشي لحاله ويتسحب باللمس — يكمل بسرعة الإصبع ثم يرجع لسرعته العادية بنعومة */
class Tape{
  constructor(wrap,inner){
    this.w=wrap; this.i=inner; this.x=0; this.v=0; this.auto=40; this.drag=false; this.hover=false; this.covered=false;
    this.samples=[]; this.last=performance.now(); this.px=0; this.pt=0; this.raf=0; this.anim=null; this.as=0; this.ah=0;
    const down=e=>{ if(e.button>0)return; this.halt(); this.drag=true; this.px=e.clientX; this.pt=performance.now();
      this.samples=[]; this.v=0; this.w.classList.add('drag'); try{this.w.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId)}catch(_){} };
    const move=e=>{ if(!this.drag)return; const now=performance.now(), dx=e.clientX-this.px, dt=Math.max(1,now-this.pt)/1000;
      this.x+=dx; this.px=e.clientX; this.pt=now; this.samples.push({v:dx/dt,t:now});
      if(this.samples.length>6)this.samples.shift(); this.wrapX(); this.apply(); };
    const up=()=>{ if(!this.drag)return; this.drag=false; this.w.classList.remove('drag');
      const now=performance.now(), s=this.samples.filter(q=>now-q.t<120);
      this.v=s.length?Math.max(-5000,Math.min(5000,s.reduce((a,q)=>a+q.v,0)/s.length)):0; this.kick(); };
    wrap.addEventListener('pointerdown',down); wrap.addEventListener('pointermove',move);
    wrap.addEventListener('pointerup',up); wrap.addEventListener('pointercancel',up);
    wrap.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>{this.hover=true;this.halt();this.kick()}); wrap.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{this.hover=false;this.kick()});
    this.loop=now=>{ this.raf=0; if(fpsSkip(this,now)){this.raf=requestAnimationFrame(this.loop);return}   // 🎞️ v3.26.8: 60/30 ⇒ أقل رسم
      const dt=Math.min(0.1,Math.max(0,(now-this.last)/1000)); this.last=now;
      if(!this.drag){ const target=this.target();
        this.v+=(target-this.v)*(1-Math.exp(-dt*1.8)); this.x+=this.v*dt; this.wrapX(); this.apply();
        if(Math.abs(this.v-target)<0.4){ this.v=target;
          if(!target)return;                               // ⏸️ واقف (الماوس فوقه · الوضع الخفيف · نافذة فوقه) — ولا رسم لحد ما يرجع يتحرك
          if(this.gpu()){this.glide();return} } }          // 🎮 v3.26.9: السرعة ثابتة ⇒ كرت الشاشة يكمّل الحركة وحده (بلا جافاسكربت بكل إطار)
      this.raf=requestAnimationFrame(this.loop); };
    this.hw=0; this.sec=0; this.measure();                 // 📏 v3.26.8: العرض ينقاس بس لما يتغيّر فعلاً (مو كل إطار)
    if(window.ResizeObserver){this.ro=new ResizeObserver(()=>this.measure());this.ro.observe(inner)}else setInterval(()=>this.measure(),2000);
    this.kick();
  }
  target(){return (this.hover||this.covered||document.documentElement.classList.contains('lite'))?0:-this.auto}
  gpu(){return typeof this.i.animate==='function'&&(FPSCAP||(FPSCAP=uiFps()))>=120}
  kick(){ if(this.anim){ if(this.gpu()&&this.target()===-this.as&&this.ah===this.hw)return; this.halt() }
    if(!this.raf){this.last=performance.now();this.raf=requestAnimationFrame(this.loop)} }
  cur(){const a=this.anim; if(!a)return this.x; return -((((a.currentTime||0)/1000)*this.as)%(this.ah||1))}
  halt(){ if(!this.anim)return; this.x=this.cur(); this.wrapX(); this.v=-this.as; this.anim.cancel(); this.anim=null; this._t=null; this.apply() }
  glide(){ const h=this.hw; if(h<=0||!this.auto)return; this.as=this.auto; this.ah=h;
    this.anim=this.i.animate([{transform:'translate3d(0px,0,0)'},{transform:`translate3d(${(-h).toFixed(1)}px,0,0)`}],{duration:h/this.as*1000,iterations:Infinity,easing:'linear'});
    this.anim.currentTime=(-this.x/this.as)*1000 }
  cover(c){ if(this.covered===c)return; this.covered=c;
    if(this.anim){ c?this.anim.pause():this.anim.play() } else this.kick() }
  measure(){const hw=(this.i.scrollWidth||0)/2; if(hw===this.hw)return; this.hw=hw; if(this.sec&&this.hw>0)this.auto=this.hw/this.sec; if(this.anim)this.kick()}
  half(){return this.hw}
  wrapX(){const h=this.half(); if(h<=0)return; while(this.x<=-h)this.x+=h; while(this.x>0)this.x-=h}
  apply(){const t=this.x.toFixed(1); if(t===this._t)return; this._t=t; this.i.style.transform=`translate3d(${t}px,0,0)`}
  setLoop(sec){this.sec=Math.max(10,+sec||45); const h=this.half(); if(h>0)this.auto=h/this.sec; if(this.anim&&this.as!==this.auto)this.kick()}
}
